Hi {Owner},

I build websites and software for childcare groups around {City}. {Business Name} looks wonderful in its posts, but the site puts every centre on one page and each waitlist is a separate form.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a centre finder with a page and tour booking for each centre, openings by age room, fees and funding by centre, one waitlist across the group and an educator careers hub, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It feeds your childcare management system:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, the build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, openings updates and changes. If not, no problem, the sample comes down at the end of the month.

Worth thirty minutes with you and whoever runs enrolments?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
